explanation.text:
Document-partitioned (local) secondary index:

Partition 0: records {car_1, car_5, ...}  |  local index: {red: [car_1], blue: [car_5]}
Partition 1: records {car_2, car_7, ...}  |  local index: {red: [car_7], green: [car_2]}
Partition 2: records {car_3, car_6, ...}  |  local index: {red: [car_3], blue: [car_6]}

Write car_8 (red) → goes to Partition 1 → updates only Partition 1's local index. (fast)
Query color=red  → must query ALL partitions, merge results.             (scatter-gather)
